        "TileImage": "$($repository 6322f527-e0a7-4a6b-87f7-9a31c7a92374).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rYour targets are Dr. Jones Yama and Harrington McDonald,  archeologists, and the 6th &amp; 7th Viceroys of Queen Anne II.\r\rIt is a rare occurence to have 2 of Queen Anne II&apos;s leaders present at the same location. We believe that Yama and McDonald are giving each other a hit-list of Providence defectors to track down and kill.\r\rYou must also eliminate Rand Chiravat, a bodyguard presiding over the transaction.\r\rThe ICA has a boat ready for your escape.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
